<title>UK: MOTOR RACING-FIA GT CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-FIA GT CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SILVERSTONE, England 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>FIA GT championship, second round result on Sunday:</p>
<p>(Race distance 87 laps of 5.139 km circuit) 1. Peter Kox (Netherlands)/Roberto Ravaglia (Italy) BMW-McLaren 3 hours 20 minutes 27.077 seconds (average speed 133.92 kph)</p>
<p>2. Bernd Schneider/Alezander Wurz (Germany) Mercedes 3:20:27.702</p>
<p>3. J.J. Lehto (Finland)/Steve Soper (Britain) BMW-McLaren 3:21:46.116</p>
<p>4. Andrew Gilbert-Scott (Britain)/Pierre-Henri Raphanel (France) Gulf-McLaren 3:22:05.92</p>
<p>5. Hans Stuck (Germany)/Thierry Boutsen (Belgium) Porsche 3:22:08.717</p>
<p>6. Chris Goodwin/Gary Ayles (Britain) Parabolica-McLaren 3:22:24.043</p>
<p>Championship standings after two rounds:</p>
<p>1 equal. Lehto/Soper 14</p>
<p>3 equal. Kox (Netherlands)/Ravaglia 10</p>
<p>5. Raphanel 9</p>
<p>6. Jean-Marc Gounon (France) 6.</p>
